{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_5_level_main_05-09_end","groupId":"main_5","stageId":"main_05-09","title":"孽生惡物","storyCode":"5-9","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_05-09_end.txt","sourceHash":"a31505cd22a1bb5cfc30a684e7a020ed7e2949ceb1f3890a457143785d33438e","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"梅菲斯特眼看已經無路可退，然而隨著他的話語，異變陡生！\n形勢頃刻間逆轉，但是，陳也並非沒有後手——","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第六关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rooftop"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"不堪一擊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼多同胞，居然全都被你擊潰了？我確實要重新評價一下你的實力，長官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不夠。浮士德，給她點驚喜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"頂樓的，趴下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_5_shot"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"整合運動的狙擊手......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（雖然已經做好了防範措施，但他的火力居然強到這種地步？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"這不能救你的命。在他傷到我之前，你就會死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......等等。你是之前被近衛局抓獲的那個感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"你們近衛局也讓他受了很多苦吧。雖然這和烏薩斯烙在我們身上的相比，根本不算什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才他刻意沒有瞄準你，近衛局的長官。這算是我禮節性地回報你，饒你一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，就連近衛局裡也埋藏著不安的種子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"也正是你們的腐壞和大意，讓他有機會和我們裡應外合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......整合運動，你們對你們所在的這片大地一無所知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"這句話有什麼深意嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你認為浮士德是你們整合運動營救的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"近衛局裡有許多感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"二十一個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你是不是覺得，至少有四個一定會是徹徹底底的整合運動？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"可是連他們四個也都是我安插的。他們在接應你之後，你是不是囚禁了其中一個？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"很高明，長官。她逃走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"所以現在你還意識不到自己的處境嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，我該意識到的。我的隊伍已經潰散，只剩下我任人宰割。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"近衛局內外遊蕩著缺乏戰力的士兵，我的同胞幾乎失去了抵抗能力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"你是想這麼說嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"還算有些自知之明。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼——來，我的護衛們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"起來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_014","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，唔唔，呃呃呃呃呃！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"他們身上的源石......在生長？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"那些源石會刺穿他們原本的身體結構，成為他們新的身軀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"看吧長官，看吧，這就是我的護衛，我不死的護衛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特的護衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_015","isRemote":false,"text":"【嘶嚎】"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，我的牧群，我的同胞......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_5_7_shining"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"粉塵......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"同胞們需要治療。他們需要我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"法術？各小隊，當心！敵方指揮官釋放了法術，粉塵飄散的範圍非常大！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"放心，長官，你們不是我的同胞，這和你沒有關係。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_014","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊，啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"正口運動成貝","speakerId":"avg_npc_014","isRemote":false,"text":"......呃，呃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皜剜祈撠？？斤斤？伐","speakerId":"avg_npc_014","isRemote":false,"text":"呃呃，呃呃呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_014","isRemote":false,"text":"呃呃啊啊啊啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"每非其寺巢巢郡","speakerId":"avg_npc_014","isRemote":false,"text":"......血！！血！！啊啊啊！！！啊！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"安靜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅非斯寺的群群","speakerId":"avg_npc_014","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"陳sir，不好了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"被擊倒的整合運動黏上粉塵後，身體產生了巨大的變化！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"他們重新加入了戰鬥，正在緩緩逼近陣線！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"究竟有多少整合運動產生了變化？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"全部！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"他們是我的牧群，也是我的手足。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"g7，g6。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特的牧群","speakerId":"avg_npc_014","isRemote":false,"text":"——呃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"他們不會倒下，因為我會治癒他們所有的傷痛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你像操作自己的手指一樣操作他們，他們只是你的傀儡，怎麼能叫做手足？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"在我看來兩者並無區別。為了理想，我們什麼都可以是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你把這叫做理想的話。看來，我必須要解決掉的就只有你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"有目標，有幹勁。很有魅力，長官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"火力集中！快！目標敵方指揮官！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特的護衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_015","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特的護衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_015","isRemote":false,"text":"（呻吟）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"但我的護衛不是常人能撼動的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"用肉體為指揮官擋住了爆炸......還毫髮無損？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才的火力，差不多能炸穿一層城市防壁了啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"別白費力氣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"傷口會癒合，皮肉會硬化，生命會復歸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"這些人的武器根本沒法對抗我的護衛，畢竟他們只是我為長官你一個人準備的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"同胞們，起身。別讓任何人干擾我和長官之間的談話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"陳sir，整合運動正一波又一波地向我們湧來！常規手段沒法擊潰他們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"可惡，難道他們感覺不到痛苦嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"其他小隊也遭遇了相同的狀況！徘徊在大樓外的整合運動也開始行動了，他們正衝向大樓，不斷地撞擊我們剛剛控制住的安全保衛設施！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"優先處理你們身邊的敵人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"給我滾開！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"陳sir，這些東西根本就沒有知覺，近衛局大樓也被徹底包圍了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"我們被迫進入了肉搏戰，沒法支援你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"照顧好你們自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"明白！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"很壯觀吧？他們歷經了太多戰鬥，意識似乎有些不堪重負了，但他們的肉體依然健康強壯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"實力似乎能稍稍彌補一點決策上的失誤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"至少這樣我們就有時間慢慢解決我們之間的問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"我想好好和你談談，長官，無關這場戰鬥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"沒必要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我會直接解決你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"很快！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"但還不夠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"用劍鋒偏移了弩彈？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特的護衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_015","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"預判得很準，黑髮小子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，先用狙擊阻撓我的行動，適時預測我的行動，然後填上肉盾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，長官。我大致能估算到你基本上所有的路線，下一步不過是稍加封鎖就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣一來，你是沒法靠近我的。至於尖銳的弩箭、易爆的弩彈、沉重的弩刺，你喜歡哪種？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"也許你準備得確實很周全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，一個棋手規劃完了整個棋局，他就只能將對方當做異色的棋子而非奇兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"（等等，粉塵怎麼會黏在她身上......？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"（原來是這樣，是這樣呀。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會像你那樣紙上談兵，我只是有備而來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"棋盤不適用於我，小子。我不是誰的棋子，我是龍門的利刃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"勇敢和莽撞雖然接近，卻依然留有一線之隔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"或者，你是想使用自己的底牌了？我似乎還沒見你在戰鬥裡使用另一把劍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"那不是把裝飾品，對吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"這把劍根本不是用來對付你這種人的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"無論如何，你們都不值得我拔出這把劍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，你們確實該付出代價了，為了你們對龍門、對切爾諾伯格所有無辜者所做的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"此時，此刻。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"它是你的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不需要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就當成我暫時借給你的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你不害怕？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"害怕你會對我兵刃相向？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，我不怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"因為我沒那麼怕死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這不是尋常的武器，你會慢慢理解它的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"平日裡勿要揮霍它的煞氣。斬龍之劍當有出鞘的價值。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"該向誰出劍，就由你自己選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（......竟然還在蟄伏。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（即使是這種時候也依然不肯出鞘嗎。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（但現在，赤霄，你必須飲血！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["陳"]},{"speakerId":"char_015_lmg","aliases":["近衛局成員"]},{"speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","aliases":["梅菲斯特"]},{"speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","aliases":["浮士德"]}]}
